;; Mega Man's mini game (the station stage and Dark Mega Man's room): five screens of station
;; corridor, then the boss room behind a two-tile shutter. stage.ts loads it with ?raw, so it is not
;; in the level library, the dev level select or the campaign. The robots and the weapon capsule
;; are the mini game's own entity types (World's `extraEntities`); `shutter` and `dark-megaman` are
;; taken out of the map, and the scene places them itself. Column 80's doorway (rows 11-12) is the
;; shutter, solid until it opens. scrollStop keeps the boss room out of sight until the shutter
;; opens; the camera then scrolls over and locks on columns 80-95.
id: mm-station
name: STATION ESCAPE
world: 3
stage: 1
theme: castle
music: castle
time: 400
start: 2,12
startMode: stand
camera: scroll

